st L</td><td char="(" align="char">637 (142)</td><td char="(" align="char">611 (106)</td><td char="(" align="char">476 (123)</td><td char="." align="char">8.3</td><td char="." align="char">0.5</td><td char="." align="char">0.001</td></tr><tr><td align="left">PHG total R</td><td char="(" align="char">2301 (274)</td><td char="(" align="char">1936 (429)</td><td char="(" align="char">1546 (329)</td><td char="." align="char">18.9</td><td char="." align="char">0.6</td><td char="." align="char">0.000</td></tr><tr><td align="left">PHG ant R</td><td char="(" align="char">802 (162)</td><td char="(" align="char">683 (208)</td><td char="(" align="char">518 (177)</td><td char="." align="char">8.3</td><td char="." align="char">0.5</td><td char="." align="char">0.001</td></tr><tr><td align="left">PHG middle R</td><td char="(" align="char">812 (100)</td><td char="(" align="char">693 (159)</td><td char="(" align="char">586 (140)</td><td char="." align="char">11.1</td><td char="." align="char">0.6</td><td char="." align="char">0.000</td></tr><tr><td align="left">PHG post R</td><td char="(" align="char">687 (130)</td><td char="(" align="char">558 (122)</td><td char="(" align="char">441 (115)</td><td char="." align="char">15.3</td><td char="." align="char">0.6</td><td char="." align="char">0.000</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p><italic>Note</italic> The group differences were calculated with ANCOVA (Univariate General Linear Model)</p><p><italic>HCG</italic> hippocampus, <italic>PHG</italic> parahippocampal gyrus, <italic>ant</italic> anterior, <italic>post</italic> posterior, <italic>L</italic> left, <italic>R</italic> right, <italic>SD</italic> standard deviation, <italic>r</italic> effect size by Pearson&#x02019;s correlation coefficient, <italic>p</italic> p value; <italic>F(2, 46)</italic> F-ratio and the degrees of freedom, <italic>p</italic>, <italic>r</italic> and <italic>F</italic> represent group difference</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="Tab2"><